[E0417] Error: a range of elements must be borrowed
    ╭─[ err/485_a_range_of_a_pointer_refused/main.wip:20:17 ]
    │
 20 │     val loose = p[0..2]
    │                 ───┬───
    │                    ╰───── a range of elements
    │
    │ Help: borrow it
    │
    │ Note: a slice is a view of elements that belong to someone else, so it exists only as a `&` or `&var` argument, or as what a `for` loop walks
